WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:11.582
Pip eats his slice of cake.

2
00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:19.801
Jane takes her last bite.

3
00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:23.874
"It's time to clean," Gran says.

4
00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:26.506
"One of you can sweep.

5
00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:31.873
One of you may wipe the tray."

6
00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:36.210
Pip pokes Jane. "Jane will sweep."

7
00:00:36.211 --> 00:00:47.924
"No! Pip will sweep," Jane says.

8
00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:54.067
"You two need to get along," Gran says.

9
00:00:54.068 --> 00:01:00.043
"Be sweet and not mean."

10
00:01:00.045 --> 00:01:09.278
Pip wipes the tray, and Jane sweeps.

11
00:01:09.279 --> 00:01:26.838
"I will get the mail," Gran says.

12
00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:36.443
Jane goes to look at the game.

13
00:01:36.444 --> 00:01:51.942
"Pip," Jane says. "Come see this."

14
00:01:51.943 --> 00:02:00.641
"That cake looks like Gran's cake," Pip says.

15
00:02:00.642 --> 00:02:08.857
The kids check all over the map.

16
00:02:08.858 --> 00:02:12.686
"What are those spots?" Jane asks.

17
00:02:12.687 --> 00:02:17.743
"The game does not look the same now."

18
00:02:17.744 --> 00:02:23.877
"The spots look like gray slime," Pip says.

19
00:02:23.878 --> 00:02:27.497
"I bet the Duke of Yuck made them.

20
00:02:27.498 --> 00:02:32.974
He needs to go back to jail!"

21
00:02:32.975 --> 00:02:36.408
"It's not a dream," Jane says.

22
00:02:36.409 --> 00:02:39.458
"Sweet Land is real!"

23
00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:43.413
"And the queen needs our help," Pip says.

24
00:02:43.414 --> 00:02:50.025
"We cannot wait!"

